      *> DESIGN EXAMPLE - NOT COMPILED OR PRODUCTION READY.
      *> Project-internal buffer, NOT IBM FLJB/DFHFCLGD or an ABI.
      *> Capacities below are illustrative, NOT approved production limits.
      *> D002/D004/D010 must define widths, encodings and buffer ownership.
      *> Never silently truncate a field to fit this example.
       01 CAPTURE-EVENT.
          05 CE-CONTRACT-VERSION         PIC 9(4).
          05 CE-KIND                     PIC X(8).
             88 CE-CHANGE               VALUE 'CHANGE'.
             88 CE-COMMIT                VALUE 'COMMIT'.
             88 CE-BACKOUT               VALUE 'BACKOUT'.
             88 CE-BARRIER               VALUE 'BARRIER'.
          05 CE-SOURCE-ID                PIC X(64).
          05 CE-SOURCE-EPOCH             PIC X(64).
          05 CE-LOGSTREAM-ID             PIC X(64).
          05 CE-CURSOR-LENGTH            PIC 9(5) COMP-5.
          05 CE-CURSOR-BYTES             PIC X(256).
          05 CE-RECORD-IDENTITY          PIC X(256).
          05 CE-UOW-IDENTITY             PIC X(256).
          05 CE-DATASET-ID               PIC X(64).
          05 CE-DATASET-GENERATION       PIC X(64).
          05 CE-ENTITY                   PIC X(9).
             88 CE-BALANCE               VALUE 'BALANCE'.
             88 CE-STATEMENT             VALUE 'STATEMENT'.
          05 CE-OPERATION                PIC X(6).
             88 CE-INSERT                VALUE 'INSERT'.
             88 CE-UPDATE                VALUE 'UPDATE'.
             88 CE-DELETE                VALUE 'DELETE'.
          05 CE-KEY-LENGTH               PIC 9(5) COMP-5.
          05 CE-KEY-BYTES                PIC X(256).
          05 CE-LAYOUT-ID                PIC X(64).
          05 CE-CCSID                    PIC 9(5) COMP-5.
          05 CE-AFTER-LENGTH             PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
          05 CE-AFTER-BYTES              PIC X(32768).
          05 CE-UNDO-SCOPE               PIC X(7).
             88 CE-FULL-UNDO             VALUE 'FULL'.
             88 CE-PARTIAL-UNDO          VALUE 'PARTIAL'.
          05 CE-EVIDENCE-REFERENCE       PIC X(256).
      *> Identity fields above reference normalized, length-checked values.
      *> The complete production contract also carries before images/undo
      *> targets, region incarnation, recovery context and fragments.
      *> See contracts.normalizedRecord in specs/mainframe-capture.json.
      *> DELETE has no after image. Do not infer a statement from balances.
      *> Compute eventId from proven stable source record identity; freeze
      *> it and its envelope. Do not regenerate an ID from CURRENT-DATE.
